    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column is-two-thirds-tablet">
        <p style="margin-bottom: .5em">Query: <a href="/search/advanced?terms-0-operator=AND&amp;terms-0-term=LLM+inference&amp;terms-0-field=all&amp;terms-1-operator=OR&amp;terms-1-term=GPU+kernel&amp;terms-1-field=all&amp;terms-2-operator=OR&amp;terms-2-term=model+serving&amp;terms-2-field=all&amp;terms-3-operator=OR&amp;terms-3-term=distributed+training&amp;terms-3-field=all&amp;classification-computer_science=y&amp;classification-physics_archives=all&amp;classification-include_cross_list=include&amp;date-year=&amp;date-filter_by=date_range&amp;date-from_date=2025-10-14&amp;date-to_date=2025-10-17&amp;date-date_type=submitted_date_first&amp;abstracts=show&amp;size=50&amp;order=-announced_date_first">order: -announced_date_first; size: 50; date_range: from 2025-10-14 to 2025-10-17; classification: Computer Science (cs); include_cross_list: True; terms: AND all=LLM inference; OR all=GPU kernel; OR all=model serving; OR all=distributed training</a></p>
        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="button is-link" href="/search/advanced?terms-0-operator=AND&amp;terms-0-term=LLM+inference&amp;terms-0-field=all&amp;terms-1-operator=OR&amp;terms-1-term=GPU+kernel&amp;terms-1-field=all&amp;terms-2-operator=OR&amp;terms-2-term=model+serving&amp;terms-2-field=all&amp;terms-3-operator=OR&amp;terms-3-term=distributed+training&amp;terms-3-field=all&amp;classification-computer_science=y&amp;classification-physics_archives=all&amp;classification-include_cross_list=include&amp;date-year=&amp;date-filter_by=date_range&amp;date-from_date=2025-10-14&amp;date-to_date=2025-10-17&amp;date-date_type=submitted_date_first&amp;abstracts=show&amp;size=50&amp;order=-announced_date_first">Refine query</a><a class="button" href="/search/advanced">New search</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="column is-one-third-tablet is-hidden-mobile">
        <p class="has-text-right" style="margin-top: 1em">
          
          <a href="/search/?order=-announced_date_first&amp;size=50">Simple Search</a>
          
        </p>
